  25:../libs/PoliTeKDSP/libs/libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****      *  When created, prior to initialiation, the state will be Unknown
  26:../libs/PoliTeKDSP/libs/libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****      *  
  27:../libs/PoliTeKDSP/libs/libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****      *  During initialization, the state will be changed to either FACTORY,
  28:../libs/PoliTeKDSP/libs/libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****      *  or USER. 
  29:../libs/PoliTeKDSP/libs/libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****      * 
  30:../libs/PoliTeKDSP/libs/libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****      *  If this is the first time these settings are being written to the
  31:../libs/PoliTeKDSP/libs/libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****      *  target address, the defaults will be written to that location,
  32:../libs/PoliTeKDSP/libs/libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****      *  and the state will be set to FACTORY.
  33:../libs/PoliTeKDSP/libs/libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****      * 
  34:../libs/PoliTeKDSP/libs/libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****      *  Once the first user-trigger save has been made, the state will be 
  35:../libs/PoliTeKDSP/libs/libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****      *  updated to USER to indicate that the defaults have overwritten.
  36:../libs/PoliTeKDSP/libs/libDaisy/src/util/PersistentStorage.h ****      */
